1614
01:09:54,742 --> 01:09:57,607
-This is the last cemetery.
We've seen all the others.

1615
01:09:57,641 --> 01:10:02,025
If we don't find anything here,
we'd better forget about it.

1616
01:10:02,059 --> 01:10:04,338
-Hello, there!
-Good evening.

1617
01:10:04,372 --> 01:10:05,822
Tell me, are you
the watchman here?

1618
01:10:05,856 --> 01:10:07,893
-Yes, sir.
Anything I can do for you?

1619
01:10:07,927 --> 01:10:10,413
-Why, yes. We'd like to ask you
a few questions.

1620
01:10:10,447 --> 01:10:12,794
-We'd like to know if you've
seen anything strange

1621
01:10:12,829 --> 01:10:14,969
