or more recently --

1622
01:10:15,003 --> 01:10:18,006
Anything very suspicious
in or around the cemetery

1623
01:10:18,041 --> 01:10:20,216
pertaining to one of the graves.-Just the film crew.

1624
01:10:20,250 --> 01:10:22,701
-Are you from the police?
-Yes, that's right, my friend.

1625
01:10:22,735 --> 01:10:25,531
And we're after
a very dangerous criminal

1626
01:10:25,566 --> 01:10:27,084
whom we suspect has been hiding

1627
01:10:27,119 --> 01:10:28,810
in one of the cemeteries
around the city.

1628
01:10:28,845 --> 01:10:31,882
-Well, the fact is that issomething pretty doggone curious

1629
01:10:31,917 --> 01:10:34,022
did happen just two nights ago.

1630
01:10:34,057 --> 01:10:36,162
I was surprised to run into
a young woman here

1631
01:10:36,197 --> 01:10:37,750
