1632
01:10:37,785 --> 01:10:39,131
She seemed to be asleep,

1633
01:10:39,165 --> 01:10:40,891
and two men entered the grounds
with her.

1634
01:10:40,926 --> 01:10:42,824
-He's not gonna flashback,
is he?

1635
01:10:42,859 --> 01:10:45,482
One of the guys slugged me,
and they left me out cold.

1636
01:10:45,517 --> 01:10:49,797
-How do you think I got
this swell head?

1637
01:10:49,831 --> 01:10:52,282
-Then we'll be taking a look
around the grounds.

1638
01:10:52,317 --> 01:10:55,078
-You can do anything you want.
Anything you want.

1639
01:10:55,112 --> 01:10:58,909
-You're the police.
-Don't touch him. He's filthy.

1640
01:10:58,944 --> 01:11:02,223
-You see? I was right.
At last we're on the trail.

1641
01:11:02,258 --> 01:11:04,294
Now the tough part
is yet to come.

1642
01:11:04,329 --> 01:11:07,297
Because we've got to walk aroundtill we find the mummy.

1643
01:11:07,332 --> 01:11:08,954
-Look, we'd better separate now.

1644
01:11:08,988 --> 01:11:11,577
Go that way, Pinacate.
I'll go over there.

1645
01:11:11,612 --> 01:11:13,165
-Separate?
-But I love you.

1646
01:11:13,199 --> 01:11:15,236
-Go on.

1647
01:11:15,271 --> 01:11:19,240
-[As Jerry Lewis] Ow! Dean!

1648
01:11:19,275 --> 01:11:22,899
Don't li-- Ow! Ow!

1649
01:11:22,933 --> 01:11:24,487
Hey.

1650
01:11:24,521 --> 01:11:27,938
Oh, scared and mummy and whoa!

1651
01:11:27,973 --> 01:11:30,872
