1652
01:11:30,907 --> 01:11:33,427
-[As Jerry Lewis]
Oh, very bad. Ow!

1653
01:11:33,461 --> 01:11:36,671
Oh, Dean-o! Ah-ah-ow!

1654
01:11:36,706 --> 01:11:39,398
-Lions and tigers and whoa!
-Ohh, tree, wow!

1655
01:11:39,433 --> 01:11:40,641
-[As Jerry Lewis]
Oh, ooooooooh!

1656
01:11:40,675 --> 01:11:42,953
-Scared and tree and whoa.

1657
01:11:42,988 --> 01:11:46,198
-Ohh!
-Ohh!

1658
01:11:46,232 --> 01:11:49,270
-Dean-o!
-[Normal voice] Hey.

1659
01:11:49,305 --> 01:11:51,721
-Oh. Ohh.

1660
01:11:51,755 --> 01:11:53,654
Beware all who enter, whoa!

1661
01:11:53,688 --> 01:11:56,104
-Am. Ooh.

1662
01:11:56,139 --> 01:12:00,350
♪♪

1663
01:12:00,385 --> 01:12:04,596
♪♪

1664
01:12:04,630 --> 01:12:08,807
♪♪

1665
01:12:08,841 --> 01:12:11,568
-Whoa, Dean.

1666
01:12:11,603 --> 01:12:13,570
-Dean-o!
-Dean-o!

1667
01:12:13,605 --> 01:12:17,263
-Where are you? Wow!

1668
01:12:17,298 --> 01:12:18,713
-[As Dean Martin]
Jerry. Jerry. Where are ya?

1669
01:12:18,748 --> 01:12:21,198
I can't find you.
Come on, Jerry. Where are ya?

1670
01:12:21,233 --> 01:12:23,408
Come on.
Say something to me, boy.

1671
01:12:23,442 --> 01:12:26,203
♪♪

1672
01:12:26,238 --> 01:12:28,585
-Dean, over here!

1673
01:12:28,620 --> 01:12:30,760
-Oh, there you are.
Quit horsing around.

1674
01:12:30,794 --> 01:12:33,072
We've got a mummy to find.
-Come here.

1675
01:12:36,662 --> 01:12:38,664
♪♪

1676
01:12:38,699 --> 01:12:40,459
-What happened?

1677
01:12:40,494 --> 01:12:41,978
-[Normal voice]
I'm going to get out of here.

1678
01:12:42,012 --> 01:12:43,151
-[Normal voice]
I'm getting out of here.

1679
01:12:43,186 --> 01:12:45,568
-Whoa! Joel!
-Hope those dogs ain't around.

1680
01:12:45,602 --> 01:12:48,605
♪♪

1681
01:12:48,640 --> 01:12:51,677
♪♪

1682
01:12:51,712 --> 01:12:53,645
-Come on.

1683
01:12:53,679 --> 01:12:55,681
♪♪

1684
01:12:55,716 --> 01:12:58,097
[Static]

1685
01:13:01,894 --> 01:13:06,416
[Dogs barking]

1686
01:13:06,451 --> 01:13:08,901
-I just don't see it at all,
guys.

1687
01:13:08,936 --> 01:13:10,489
-Come on, Crow.
I think it'll work.

1688
01:13:10,524 --> 01:13:12,595
You're the only one of us
who even looks a little bit

1689
01:13:12,629 --> 01:13:14,079
like Enoch, dude.

1690
01:13:14,113 --> 01:13:17,841
-No. My brow's all different.
I'm just -- No.

1691
01:13:17,876 --> 01:13:19,325
-[Normal voice]
Oh, it's there. I see it.

1692
01:13:19,360 --> 01:13:21,638
[Quietly] Joel, be sure
to wipe down his nose, huh?

1693
01:13:21,673 --> 01:13:22,915
Boy, if I were a demon dog,

1694
01:13:22,950 --> 01:13:25,228
I'd just, uh, bow down and kneeland bow to you.

1695
01:13:25,262 --> 01:13:27,403
-I'm already starting to miss
that old Enoch.

1696
01:13:27,437 --> 01:13:28,818
You know, I almost cried
when he left.

1697
01:13:28,852 --> 01:13:30,889
Just like when Old Yeller
got shot.

1698
01:13:30,923 --> 01:13:32,787
-Oh, Crow, come on.
It'll be easy.

1699
01:13:32,822 --> 01:13:34,893
You go out there,
you say to the demon dogs,

1700
01:13:34,927 --> 01:13:37,723
"Come on, everybody! Let's go!
I'll be right behind you!"

1701
01:13:37,758 --> 01:13:38,931
You duck back in. It's easy.

1702
01:13:38,966 --> 01:13:41,347
-Great advice coming from
Mr. Fireplug.

1703
01:13:41,382 --> 01:13:43,108
-Hey. Take it easy, you two.
-Hey.

1704
01:13:43,142 --> 01:13:44,972
Listen, if worse comes to worse,

1705
01:13:45,006 --> 01:13:46,456
just tell them
The Satellite of Love

1706
01:13:46,491 --> 01:13:48,389
is a giant chicken bone, okay?

1707
01:13:48,424 --> 01:13:50,115
You look great.
Now just go do the job.

1708
01:13:50,149 --> 01:13:51,599
Be regal.
-All right.

1709
01:13:51,634 --> 01:13:55,258
I like Charlie McCarthy.
-Let's watch on the monitor.

1710
01:13:55,292 --> 01:13:57,467
-All right. Quiet down.
Quiet down.

1711
01:13:57,502 --> 01:13:59,952
Ahem! I am Enoch.

1712
01:13:59,987 --> 01:14:03,473
I am your lord and charismatic
leader, remember?

1713
01:14:03,508 --> 01:14:05,475
And, uh...Hey, what's the leash law here?!

1714
01:14:05,510 --> 01:14:06,407
[Urine spraying]
Hey! Oh! Hey! Hey!

1715
01:14:06,442 --> 01:14:07,477
-Oh, he's getting it. Ooh!

1716
01:14:07,512 --> 01:14:09,583
-Hey, curb your buddy
over there. Aw!

1717
01:14:09,617 --> 01:14:11,619
[Groans]

1718
01:14:11,654 --> 01:14:14,242
[All groaning]

1719
01:14:14,277 --> 01:14:18,246
-[Chuckles] Kind of a warm
feeling, eh, Crow?

1720
01:14:18,281 --> 01:14:20,835
-Well, I think it went
kind of well, you know?

1721
01:14:20,870 --> 01:14:23,286
They were eating out of
the palm of my hand --

1722
01:14:23,320 --> 01:14:24,839
till I ran out of treats.

1723
01:14:24,874 --> 01:14:27,117
-And speaking of treats,
we'll be right back.

1724
01:14:27,152 --> 01:14:32,122
♪♪

1725
01:14:33,917 --> 01:14:36,713
♪♪

1726
01:14:36,748 --> 01:14:39,785
♪♪

1727
01:14:39,820 --> 01:14:44,721
-They're in the crypt.
Demon dogs everywhere.

1728
01:14:44,756 --> 01:14:46,654
♪♪

1729
01:14:46,689 --> 01:14:49,692
-What to do? It's scaring me.

1730
01:14:49,726 --> 01:14:51,556
-You get all that stuff
off you, Crow?

1731
01:14:51,590 --> 01:14:54,490
-Yes, I did.

1732
01:14:54,524 --> 01:14:56,043
Great idea.

1733
01:14:56,077 --> 01:14:59,460
-Look, the breastplate
and the bracelet.

1734
01:14:59,495 --> 01:15:01,220
-They didn't take it.

1735
01:15:01,255 --> 01:15:05,431
-All this I've just told you
