2231
01:36:18,634 --> 01:36:20,602
-Ugh! Yeah.
It was mixing medias.

2232
01:36:20,636 --> 01:36:23,501
I could see that plot
coming a mile away.

2233
01:36:23,536 --> 01:36:24,986
It's crushed.

2234
01:36:25,020 --> 01:36:27,367
-I can see now that
this completely isn't working.

2235
01:36:27,402 --> 01:36:28,644
We gotta get rid
of these things.

2236
01:36:28,679 --> 01:36:30,370
Quick, check your files.

2237
01:36:30,405 --> 01:36:31,716
-We're almost out
of cheeseburgers.

2238
01:36:31,751 --> 01:36:33,995
-Yeah. Newspapers, too. Ouch!

2239
01:36:34,029 --> 01:36:35,790
-What gets a dog going on earth?

2240
01:36:35,824 --> 01:36:38,240
-Well, uh, chasing rabbits,
sticks, cars,

2241
01:36:38,275 --> 01:36:41,140
licking, scratching, uh,
tennis balls, uh...

2242
01:36:41,174 --> 01:36:42,900
-That's it! Tennis balls!

2243
01:36:42,935 --> 01:36:45,351
Listen, go down
to the service pod.

2244
01:36:45,385 --> 01:36:47,871
Find the thrusters up at 33-A.

2245
01:36:47,905 --> 01:36:50,321
Attach 'em to that
big disposal ball

2246
01:36:50,356 --> 01:36:51,944
that's shaped like a giant ball.

2247
01:36:51,978 --> 01:36:53,911
We'll push it out
the bay port door.

2248
01:36:53,946 --> 01:36:58,502
Get down there. Keep your
fingers crossed if you got 'em.

2249
01:36:58,536 --> 01:37:01,677
Okay.
Cambot, put me on exterior.

2250
01:37:01,712 --> 01:37:04,888
Put in fetch mode
on my mark -- Now!

2251
01:37:04,922 --> 01:37:06,959
[Barking continues]

2252
01:37:06,993 --> 01:37:12,447
♪♪

2253
01:37:12,481 --> 01:37:17,935
♪♪

2254
01:37:17,970 --> 01:37:20,731
-All right! They're gone!

2255
01:37:20,765 --> 01:37:22,388
-Oh, uh, Joel,

2256
01:37:22,422 --> 01:37:25,494
I don't want to be a killjoy,
but doesn't fetch mean...

2257
01:37:25,529 --> 01:37:28,532
go get and bring back?

2258
01:37:28,566 --> 01:37:29,809
-Oh!
-Doh!

2259
01:37:29,844 --> 01:37:32,191
-Ohh!
-[Sighs]

2260
01:37:32,225 --> 01:37:34,089
-That's the end
of our experiment.

2261
01:37:34,124 --> 01:37:36,160
I hope you're happy.

2262
01:37:36,195 --> 01:37:39,232
-Oh, I'm happy.
-Are you happy?

2263
01:37:39,267 --> 01:37:44,686
-I'm happy.
-Good. File this.

2264
01:37:44,720 --> 01:37:48,069
-Well, until next time,
my little square pudding.

2265
01:37:50,312 --> 01:37:52,728
[ "Mighty Science Theater"
plays]

